! G.frr — Stub AS, customer of A
!
! G has a single upstream connection to provider A (10.1.2.2).
!
! As a stub, G:
!   - Announces only its own prefix (10.255.7.1/32) to A via the 'network' statement.
!   - Accepts all routes from A for global reachability.
!   - Provides no transit to any other AS.
!
! Money logic: G pays A for transit. No other commercial relationships exist.

route-map FROM-PROVIDER permit 10
 set local-preference 100
!
router bgp __ASN__
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  neighbor 10.1.2.2 route-map FROM-PROVIDER in
 exit-address-family
!
